== OPEN-4 (Marcelo Fortes, 2026-10-10): a local that is never read is an error.
== The misspelled name declares a new variable that nothing reads, so the typo
== is caught.
Module Diagnostics.UnreadTypo

Main :
    Counter := 1
    Coutner := Counter + 1
    PutLn(Counter)
;
